I don't know how the game you're playing was compiled (maybe without HARD
set?), but this is _not_ right.  As a wizard, you start out with 2 uncursed
spellbooks, and unless they're pretty useless, you can't read them successfully
until you have 15-20 power points.  Now, if the spellbook is _blessed_, you
can always read it successfully.

